# fixedbugs, defect 592, lane b20-pragma, 2026-10-11, a shape beside
# `fixedbugs-592-a-header-renaming-a-runtime-name-is-told-on-its-group`:
# the header declares `hero_print_int` again with an `__asm__` label, which
# clang takes, nothing having called it yet, the same cause and the same
# exit 2 before.
# Defect 640, lane b21-win, 2026-10-11: the binding was `labs`, whose `long`
# is 32 bits on Windows, so `labs(x: i64)` was refused there before the
# link; `llabs` is `long long` on every platform.

extern "fixedbugs-592-a-header-labelling-a-runtime-function-by-asm-is-told.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    function llabs(x: i64) -> i64

function main()
    print(llabs(-42))
